      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: I will join into the world and get around 4 seconds of being able to look around / walk around but after that my oculus gives me a frozen screen with the loading hourglass in the bottom right. Friends of mine have also told me they have a similar issue, but instead its with the filesize of the map. They said anything over 300mb will cause them a black screen on desktop. (They do not use vr)",
